How can I implement the bubble sort algorithm in Java?
[Java code]
public static void bubbleSort(int[] arr) {
    int n = arr.length;
    int temp = 0;
    for(int i=0; i < n; i++){
        for(int j=1; j < (n-i); j++){
            if(arr[j-1] > arr[j]){
                //swap elements
                temp = arr[j-1];
                arr[j-1] = arr[j];
                arr[j] = temp;
            }
        }
    }
}

